OL,3,GNEWSAPermission for half-built
OL,4,Atravellers' site refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn attempt to get planning approval for
OL,7,Fa travellers' site after work had
OL,8,Falready begun has failed.
OL,10,FConstruction began on the site in
OL,11,FAshley Green near Chesham on 2 April
OL,12,Fthis year.
OL,14,FBuckinghamshire councillors were
OL,15,Fadvised by their officers to offer
OL,16,Fretrospective permission for the
OL,17,Fproject, but they decided to refuse.
OL,19,FThe planning agent for the travellers
OL,20,Fsaid they started work without consent
OL,21,Fbecause they needed somewhere to live.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
